                <p>Embedding predictive machine learning models and intelligent automation modules into web/mobile backends for real-time data analysis.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="offer-card">
                <div class="card-graphic">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-hotel"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Hotel & Management Software</h3>
                <p>Custom booking management engines, room inventory trackers, reservation systems, and automated billing solutions for hospitality businesses.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="offer-card">
                <div class="card-graphic">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>B2B Wholesale Portals</h3>
                <p>High-volume order management systems tailored for distributors and bulk suppliers, complete with custom catalog visibility and tier pricing.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="offer-card">
                <div class="card-graphic">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>SEO & Speed Optimization</h3>
                <p>Search engine optimization, Core Web Vitals performance tuning, lazy loading, and asset minification to ensure top search rankings and fast load times.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="offer-card">
                <div class="card-graphic">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Google Ads & Lead Growth</h3>
                <p>Targeted PPC campaign management, conversion tracking analytics, and landing page funnels to maximize ROI and generate targeted leads.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="offer-card">
                <div class="card-graphic">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-nib"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>UI/UX & Modern Web Design</h3>
                <p>Human-centered user interface design incorporating responsive layouts, dark mode glassmorphism styles, and micro-interactions.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="offer-card">
                <div class="card-graphic">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up"></i>
